Angaian Translations

	Philosophy

		-
			This document specifies translations for Angaian terms into other languages.
		-

	Principles

		Hebrew

			Kaeon

				Name
				
					Whole: 'קאיון'

					Components

						Kae: 'קאי'
						On: 'ון'
						
				Content
				
					'תַּקֵּן אֶת כָּל הָעוֹלָם׃'
					'גְּמֹר גְּמִירַת הָעוֹלָם׃'